              <strong>One inbox for replies and mentions</strong>
              Read the mentions and replies for each account you run, then reply without leaving the app.
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="tour-card">
            <div class="browser-frame">
              <div class="browser-bar" aria-hidden="true">
